    "text": "Mix 94.7 KMCH\nwebsite\nIowa\nLaw Enforcement Looking for Violators of Move Over Law\nBy Janelle Tucker,\n12 hours agoLaw enforcement across Iowa are taking part in a nationwide effort this week to promote the “Move Over, It’s the Law” program. Trooper Paul Gardner, of the Iowa State Patrol, says it’s been the law in Iowa for more than 20 years, but it’s only recently been passed in all 50 states.\n6",
